WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.416
At a paper speed of twenty-five millimetres per second, each horizontal one-millimetre box represents zero point zero four seconds. Five small boxes form one large box, representing zero point two seconds. These conversions apply only after you confirm the actual recording speed.
纸速为每秒25毫米时，水平1毫米小格表示0.04秒；5个小格构成一个大格，表示0.20秒。这些换算只有在确认实际纸速后才适用。

00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:37.872
At standard gain, ten vertical millimetres represent one millivolt. A shorter calibration mark may reflect deliberately reduced gain rather than a broken machine. Read the stated setting, verify the calibration mark and document it before interpreting voltage or comparing recordings.
标准增益下，垂直10毫米表示1毫伏。校准标记较短可能是刻意降低增益，而不一定是机器损坏。解释电压或比较记录前，应读取设置、核对校准标记并记录。

00:00:37.872 --> 00:00:59.208
First choose the physiological endpoints, then count boxes. For a QRS spanning three and a half small boxes at standard speed, multiply three point five by zero point zero four: zero point one four seconds, or one hundred forty milliseconds. That is a wide complex by the school reference.
先确定生理端点，再数格。标准纸速下，QRS 跨3.5个小格，则3.5乘0.04，得到0.14秒，即140毫秒；按学校参考范围属于宽波群。

00:00:59.208 --> 00:01:18.072
State the unit every time. Multiplying by zero point zero four gives seconds, not milliseconds. To express the same result in milliseconds, multiply seconds by one thousand. This unit discipline is especially important in the QTc calculation later in the module.
每次都应说明单位。乘以0.04得到的是秒，不是毫秒；要表示为毫秒，还须将秒乘1000。这个单位纪律在稍后的 QTc 计算中特别重要。

00:01:18.072 --> 00:01:36.528
Measure voltage vertically from a suitable baseline to the chosen peak or nadir. Twelve millimetres at standard gain corresponds to one point two millivolts. If gain changes, the same millimetre height represents a different voltage, so a visual comparison alone is unreliable.
电压应从适当的基线垂直量至选定峰或谷。标准增益下，12毫米对应1.2毫伏；增益改变后，同样毫米高度代表不同电压，因此只看高度比较并不可靠。

00:01:36.528 --> 00:01:54.408
Small waves may be harder to measure because of body habitus, electrode contact or baseline motion. Improve the signal and repeat a borderline measurement. Do not assign a precise amplitude to an obscured endpoint, and do not translate voltage into the strength of the pulse.
体型、电极接触或基线运动会使小波难以测量。应改善信号并复测临界值，不能给遮蔽的端点分配精确振幅，也不能把电压换算成脉搏强度。

00:01:54.408 --> 00:02:16.872
For a regular rhythm at standard speed, divide three hundred by the number of large boxes between consecutive R peaks. Four large boxes gives seventy-five beats per minute. The landmark sequence three hundred, one fifty, one hundred, seventy-five, sixty, fifty is the same relationship expressed without division.
标准纸速的规则节律可用300除以相邻 R 峰之间的大格数。4个大格得到每分钟75次。300、150、100、75、60、50的定位序列，是同一关系的免除法表达。

00:02:16.872 --> 00:02:36.840
The shortcut assumes both a known speed and a representative regular RR interval. If intervals vary substantially, one short interval exaggerates the average rate and one long interval underestimates it. Examine regularity before choosing this method, even though rate is step two in the school framework.
这种捷径同时假定纸速已知，且所选 RR 规则、有代表性。间期显著变化时，单个短间期会高估平均心率，长间期会低估。因此即使学校框架把心率列为第二步，也须先检查规则性来选择算法。

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:56.088
For an irregular rhythm, count ventricular complexes within a verified six-second window and multiply by ten. Eight complexes gives an estimated eighty per minute. Confirm the duration from printed time marks or a known grid speed rather than assuming that any strip is six seconds long.
不规则节律可在确认为6秒的窗口内数心室波群，再乘10。8个波群约为每分钟80次。应依据时间标记或已知纸速确认时长，不能假定任意一条记录都是6秒。

00:02:56.088 --> 00:03:15.672
The general calculation is counted beats multiplied by sixty, divided by the number of seconds sampled. Short windows give less precise averages, especially when the rhythm varies. Report an approximate ventricular rate and the irregularity rather than presenting the number as an exact constant.
通用公式为计数搏动数乘60，再除以取样秒数。短窗口在节律变化时平均值精度较低。应报告约数和不规则特点，而不是把数值当成准确不变的常数。

00:03:15.672 --> 00:03:35.832
Use calipers or a straight edge when helpful, and remeasure a borderline result. Check the J point for ST displacement, not the T-wave peak. If motion or poor contact prevents reliable measurement, correct what you can and acquire another tracing while continuing patient care.
可使用卡尺或直尺，并复测临界结果。ST 偏移应找 J 点，不是 T 波峰。若运动或接触不良妨碍可靠测量，应在继续照护患者的同时尽量纠正问题并重取记录。

00:03:35.832 --> 00:03:54.936
Document the setting and measurement, the limitation that affected confidence, and whether repetition changed the finding. Do not label every unusual number a machine fault. A correctly recorded wide QRS is a clinical observation, whereas wrong speed assumptions are an interpretation error.
记录设置、测量值、影响把握度的局限及复测是否改变结果。不要把所有异常数值都称作机器故障：技术正确的宽 QRS 是临床发现，纸速假设错误则是判读错误。
